# Reviewer decisions for candidate L1 (Codex pass 0001 claims). Grammar: _tools/build.py docstring.
# L1 ownership headers: knowledge skills "Level: 2-technology · Owns: <X> technique · Loading: on demand" (angular,
# dotnet-testing, ef-core are capability facets "Owns: ... technique and examples"); git-workflow, security-scan
# "Level: 0-core · Owns: ... procedure · Loading: on invocation"; project-structure "Level: 3-project · Owns:
# scaffolding and restructuring procedure"; scan-layers.md "Owns: layer-by-layer investigation technique ...
# (private reference of security-scan) · Loading: read by security-scan"; capabilities/frontend/angular/commands.md
# "Facet: frontend.commands · Owns: frontend scaffold, install, build, test, audit commands and build-fix notes ·
# Loading: read by project-structure, verify, build-fix, development-workflow, security-scan".
# Revisions CIS-L1-U0008-R1 / U0009-R1 / U0010-R1 change only closest_policy_ids to RUN-022 (applied, non-binding).

@@ CIS-L1-0001
disp: NOT_AN_INDEPENDENT_CONSTRAINT
